                                + ".  PARK this paper -- do not write REJECTED.md.  Harden at "
                                  "fixed answer length instead (bigger ground set with the same "
                                  "witness size, larger modulus, denser decoys, tighter "
                                  "constraints) and re-run."),
                        }
                        break
