## Use

```python
import random
import gen_2402_08332 as gen

params = gen.DIFFICULTY[gen.SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY]
inst = gen.make_instance(seed=17, **params)
statement = gen.render(inst)
candidate = gen.parse_answer(f"<answer>{inst['answer']}</answer>")
